<item>
<title>离岸信托追税1200亿，10月个税猛增近九成；港媒：财政缺口逼追税11月11日，税务总局披露，离岸信托收益征税90天过渡</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10503</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10503</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:58:09 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>离岸信托追税1200亿，10月个税猛增近九成；港媒：财政缺口逼追税</b><br/><br/>11月11日，税务总局披露，离岸信托收益征税90天过渡期已结束，累计申报个税超1600亿元，其中10月入库超1200亿元，带动全国10月个税收入增长近90%。按7月新规，资产转入信托、每年增值收益及信托终止时均按20%征税。<br/><br/>税务总局称绝大多数纳税人积极配合，未申报或申报不实者将被加收滞纳金，经督促仍不申报的立案稽查，情节恶劣的公开曝光。《明报》引合规顾问称，各省市执行松紧略有分别，并引消息称，部分地方政府愿与富豪商讨缴税安排，包括减免部分税款。<br/><br/>《南华早报》引彭博指数称，全球最富500人中有8人或受影响，包括网易丁磊和拼多多黄峥。《明报》另引复旦学者称，地方财政缺口扩大正迫使税务部门深挖税源。<br/><br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E">#经济</a> <a href="?q=%23%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D">#金融</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1">#监管</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《新华社》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34453185" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">离岸信托收益征税平稳有序推进，10月当月入库超1200亿元</a><br/>《明报》<a href="https://news.mingpao.com/pns/%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F/article/20261102/s00004/1793551765285" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">內地追稅 業界料掀富豪財富搬家潮 離岸信託須納稅 資產或轉移美 港恐受影響</a>（2026-11-02）<br/>《南华早报》<a href="https://www.scmp.com/economy/china-economy/article/3374094/taxing-rich-chinas-offshore-trust-crackdown-nets-us24-billion" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">Taxing the rich? China&#39;s offshore trust crackdown nets US&#036;24 billion（向富人征税？中国离岸信托整治收获240亿美元）</a><br/>《明报》<a href="https://news.mingpao.com/pns/%e7%b6%93%e6%bf%9f/article/20261102/s00004/1793551765631" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">话你知：地方财政缺口扩大 逼税局加强税源管理</a>（2026-11-02）</div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/LqF4_HbSGJwTgP4JAr8IL9OSdIXW0XiA_L28s1ZbVR7t_cJfDFYM0Z7d4DDd7ExPIFU6z_WQt7o7D5VyQSdFgN2iHQF7FRD30jxv81jsclFxxIxBs6t2Il2UKCJg1d-5hwn2a3VISLVx0w52g5-LpOIT3dyiG0Zlkl0ii0l-dp37yTrIBNln65rhZ8810lCory5W7nJG94ncH3hMr_toD_4EEyaSkuBnhZplugfrQ5rRbGrFbtjcRcXP66xRt1UUBvMpCW6nKC_VnNNhnfuyYGKkds1job5_6KvNVqe4Hhvtata7zh1ugpdMb6qKqre-TmGMVcEnTMfi3a-tHa1l8Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/lqyhSRM0HKEzuFBiNqZAeldVooXEWsImgY2TqXTApkOA9HbHRorAv4PqAl5BjraRFgVmATawtivr6R3BSRmXVpKx5MBmbRwlFr_wzdDZt7BFnINYglZGdp4XSoAWdr3b95fRIVo2zVN2EfKy8fnoQEIkn_bepuEX1sDRupRngD3awtClMXHL9y4x2gw6EHhORHsRNF83niXr0P-7W8uYgF_l3WYH7cmygraH2KxjiMKM2KiJHCQxUe1qUaCLeqadYHAfpmg6v9LWpgwkQnkVhMP94lZLuukG7PhjWcL8RQirnvuE71NFHznmszxUTh0qmwjkf3TIhi9trO_G-3pL-A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/tDe-t1ZchWJKW7bt0-z9AuvUFvPpMuR_blObvSoeE5I389zWCizQGRpoJX-zs2efDJqDbq86PcAmdVsGS53csTAgAKfWYJTJvFOSsq9IK7cHjYSuSt9jPiXwirnuCHXbLzxoOsNf-6PmFMoO8BW0SrEPXNBb2zv5_5jeE1ERTPGvvLypaP5b_5aebYakGXHwyK0KbeYrftmVsx8iuDjBsXTTJVI03LBxT7Ex2phva-evU0ZMWKzvrkTVbka6DRk8BnWqQsJuDAAF0cxOCungOJWtKKZONXajTtb1y_UGHdC8POujwZVcobRh0972wWvbXoSKFPHiOwfesvaRRwyaTg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/eCELJKvsCOZ7IWu0Htrb1iFE5ogjFd9zEbxgxPAN_UyzBShEXY8-XzQoSW70PTJq-vGtD0JvAvWtK_ISPWW1tOdLTAjgKp7v0hccU_NMnMwus5FJ-HC5umd7hp8gYAciG1kFlk9_J5eWs-mQF8TMNuX_paEu0af05HMDEqyFxvmzmqY8Lgy-q-V8tIM02MpSD3d9LW1p-E90RKWXhFYwuYTYZ15SvxcGIBURhg2uSCxQRzLJCjQLZ-567KSp94J5qo3mqnlILEMMRIxW---VeQZFlgAYDx66WC26OTTjgqRjAU8V3qMzUyofHmqg3WJljtf5gwdz4ltOSQlnjYh6jQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9695.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A8.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
