<title>挖掘机拆西安政务中心  网民称“反向强拆”  新京报视频遭删除11月9日，西安一名47岁男子驾挖掘机开进西咸新区政务服务</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10494</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10494</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:10:46 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>挖掘机拆西安政务中心  网民称“反向强拆”  新京报视频遭删除</b><br/><br/>11月9日，西安一名47岁男子驾挖掘机开进西咸新区政务服务中心，拆毁门头。据中媒报道，至少6处建筑结构受损。警方称胡某某已被采取刑事强制措施，无人受伤，官方通报未说明动机。<br/><br/>据中国数字时代，网传原因有三，均未证实：被拖欠工程款、不满养殖场拆迁补偿、回迁和过渡费被拖欠。据港媒报道，当地工作人员称无关工程款，称胡某某的养殖场已按政策赔偿，但他对赔偿不满。有媒体指出，官方应说明双方分歧及有无正常协调。<br/><br/>据李老师，《新京报》视频发布不久被作者删除。网民称胡某某为“挖掘机勇士”，认为他报复对准政府、没有伤及无辜；也有人称这是“反向强拆”。目前国内针对此事的视频和讨论受到严格审查。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%B7%B2404">#已404</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%BB%B4%E6%9D%83">#维权</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89">#西安</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《澎湃新闻》<a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34442911" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">陕西西安警方通报一政务服务中心门头遭挖掘机破坏：嫌疑人胡某某（男，47岁）已被采取刑事强制措施</a><br/>《东网》<a href="https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/bkn-20261110131157582-1110_00822_001.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">男子驾挖掘机毁政务中心 传长期信访不满致过激行为</a><br/>《中国数字时代》<a href="https://chinadigitaltimes.net/chinese/733778.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">【CDTV】西安挖掘机勇士“反向强拆”：冤有头债有主，这次真找了政府</a><br/>《联合早报》<a href="https://www.zaokanbao.com/news/china/202611/1085237.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">下午察：当有人开挖掘机破坏政务中心</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/nBAg17WxvbUZImL_V4aszjPkXSAiw7oJGP8J39rIM20Z44Jn-_9n3B8yDCrkMQmmzC4tCtJ-Vp5H1zfJzoBgF2BLXgwLx1osvBtWKKz5RcBaXqGLnsgIqoeKIKgJY1Jf4pQx4zouKqI1CJs74dCUJPf0xkjpnn3njqaaM44UdUSoRwq8V_S6zEEGgmd6Xt5Mfxp2NKksMaJ5Fe_Cj-mRUCg56_ikVOaiEzxQ5R5DjvsXk5LKUmWK5z0z08BXU3nNDGPADMmdqgLyHaBlD0qKEpnwzFGKeDBDv338nJNauYouBWSZN1MKaMdGilxO9KVEdUfLcfguPZSLaNVDaYPSbg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/KjFOZyBbl5gYO7xGaLtYYnEskmETN-8iHiifakmuaCr4OJ-rIhooCXVnKNmwi4totZU43Of-0MqPYljhJwsvnB49ZZ-DjzjzSrghEKAtEevfnL2INDmABq6yZwTm6z3A7_dB6bGBMz9Eam3XcYucZUUmMx19OYEXRJz7UMb3201NT6ny7StDDwhLzmWXVWCfMJzHKJNNaxGygJTOcAyWBOVV63olZ-A0n_GR4T-QBTl-RPZvObMu1hiNFTEJfYrp7g3t-dfq4khZeLO4Xgmi11-X0IJb8fMoEvf7v4qfFKLY7cGXApB9mNLoSWw3oVhhtBpinxubuQwVSJ6Ik5Jtdw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/SUrztvqQOZapGTDD9REimtg3CQr-22SsTYxGMkcVdiGZZ-fZ91lndAPUA_2JL8tJ8hAp2Zbtcv7X_8xnBFvx9taJGBF0__76Jvq7lhashYsKeWN2SJzpysKn1wzeJ6-1TAr9lkz9Tsba8PXMIeMCYiVQdDht7z91SclQLh4YvYTWQImZhkdbaGwUUKV8ZKZCPss2sYkVAi4NlGkRQkruPI-iwE2Ww9NagqtY7XnAq-kcqFfC6wc8JJmyRF2BmsZsLjXt7WB5aNmGoUBNe2uvkVIkMK-CUeMRFoS0tNS5WKvxkgTuB0AcQy5joOWvmlPBVlU_xU9mT-j9I3ePwz4XYA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/QSEyEWqpcUgkXk8F0cEAPT5uqTMpuddSgmcTNsiAuC4FfGNphs2uDcgYFlsLcS4TAfk0CQGy3y1efKQ8aWrwEotZwEiBaCwmwMH2v9qy__oQgIiBTNR1qAsWbLNavOdq4JD2Q4bdCAvDC1TbcE6T67fyY6WR7v7QJAaA3c8SbAt3kMO7OXhSSD-A2CGA1OIcco8rbGUZmo3sgEP0QSp5hk4RLENZUm0qP-H_fZSq7z9cRvUuKMj8xsssf6hupTbThL4yIBZwPOH0Hgh1Qxp_QpykL6ZcuXbiCnYQGsA_YN_O4dyoZbPN8uoxoeE76I0CRyDPOlP9vbKFIzbhFlVvFw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8E89.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.pn